flowchart LR
  MAIN0[(main)] -->|branch| FEAT[feature/ticket-id_desc]
  FEAT -->|dev work| DEV[bundle deploy -t dev]
  DEV -->|dev done, push to QA| QA[bundle deploy -t qa]
  QA -->|QA passed| PR[PR to main - approval Kishan / Chenna]
  PR -->|approved| MAIN1[(main)]
  MAIN1 -->|on merge| PROD[bundle deploy -t prod - service principal]
  MAIN1 -.branch from main.-> HOT[hotfix/ticket-id_desc]
  HOT --> HQA[bundle deploy -t qa - quick test]
  HQA --> HPR[Expedited PR - approval Kishan / Chenna]
  HPR --> MAIN1
